{"subject": "📊 Daily Portfolio: Price feed down (Day 36) | SPXC exit unconfirmed 51 days", "html_body": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f5f7; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #111827;\">\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"background-color: #f4f5f7; padding: 24px 12px;\">\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\">\n      <table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"600\" style=\"max-width: 600px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden;\">\n\n        <!-- HERO BANNER -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e293b 0%, #334155 100%); padding: 32px 24px; color: #ffffff;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #94a3b8;\">Daily Portfolio Check</p>\n            <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 16px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #cbd5e1;\">Thursday, October 15, 2026 — Kuwait time</p>\n\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n              <tr>\n                <td>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Total P&L</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0 0; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; color: #f59e0b;\">⚠️ UNAVAILABLE <span style=\"font-size: 13px; opacity: 0.8; font-weight: 400;\">— price feed blocked, Day 36</span></p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n\n            <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #e2e8f0;\">🎯 <strong>Investment goal:</strong> ~$535.17 / $1,000 (last IBKR-confirmed, Oct 6 — 9 days stale) — <strong>~$464.83 to go</strong> (~53.5% there)</p>\n\n            <p style=\"margin: 16px 0 0 0; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid #475569; font-size: 13px; color: #e2e8f0;\">36th straight day with zero live price access — full DNS-level network block confirmed again this morning across Yahoo, stooq, and a google.com control fetch.</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- DECISIONS NEEDED -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 16px 24px; background-color: #fef3c7; border-bottom: 1px solid #fde68a;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #92400e; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">⚠️ Decisions needed</p>\n            <p style=\"margin: 6px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #78350f; line-height: 1.5;\">\n              1. <strong>SPXC — confirm the exit, 51 calendar days overdue.</strong> Two independent IBKR snapshots (Sep 29, Oct 6, 8 days apart) show cash at $432.16 with only GOOG open — consistent with the $205 TP limit filling, not the stop. Confirm the fill in IBKR, then run portfolio-manager to remove the position and sync cash.<br>\n              2. <strong>GOOG — get one live quote.</strong> 36 days blind. Last triangulated web snapshot (Oct 10 close, $347.86) is ~4.2% clear of the $333.90 stop, but that's 5 days stale and never IBKR-confirmed.\n            </p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- MACRO CONTEXT -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 20px 24px 0 24px;\">\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #0d0d0d; border-left: 3px solid #f59e0b; border-radius: 6px;\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding: 16px 18px;\">\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #f59e0b; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">🌍 Macro Context — Oct 15, 2026</p>\n                  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #e5e7eb; font-family: monospace;\">\n                    <tr><td style=\"padding: 2px 0;\">Buffett Indicator:</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">~234%&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: #450a0a; color: #fca5a5; padding: 1px 8px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 11px;\">🔴 ALL-TIME EXTREME</span></td></tr>\n                    <tr><td style=\"padding: 2px 0;\">S&P Forward P/E:</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">~20.0x&nbsp;&nbsp;(vs. 5yr avg 19.9x / 10yr avg 19.0x)</td></tr>\n                    <tr><td style=\"padding: 2px 0;\">Trend:</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">→ Flat-to-slightly-down from ~22x earlier in 2026</td></tr>\n                  </table>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 10px 0 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #d1d5db; line-height: 1.6;\">Two very different signals today: forward P/E (~20x) says roughly fair value, but cap-to-GDP (~234%) and CAPE (~41.6, near record) say historically extreme — the gap is almost entirely a small number of mega-caps carrying the index. Sources disperse 218.5%–252% on the Buffett Indicator alone depending on GDP vintage and market-cap source.</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 6px 0 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #d1d5db; line-height: 1.6;\">For you: nothing changes the stop discipline. The dispersion is a reason to trust your own stop-limit levels over any single macro headline.</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0 0; font-size: 11px; color: #6b7280;\">Last historical episodes at this level: 2000 dot-com peak, 2021 COVID bubble peak — see buffett-indicator-history.html.</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- POSITION NEWS -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 16px 24px 0 24px;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\">📰 Position News</p>\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280; line-height: 1.5;\">No open position currently carries <code>enhanced_news_watch: true</code> in portfolio.json — scan not run today. (GOOG and SPXC are both plain momentum/exit-mode holds, not binary-catalyst watches.)</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- POSITION SNAPSHOT TABLE -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 20px 24px 0 24px;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\">Position Snapshot</p>\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n              <thead>\n                <tr style=\"background-color: #f9fafb;\">\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 10px 8px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Status</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 10px 8px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Ticker</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: right; padding: 10px 8px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Close</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: right; padding: 10px 8px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Day</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: right; padding: 10px 8px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">P&L $</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: right; padding: 10px 8px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">P&L %</th>\n                </tr>\n              </thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 12px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px; background-color: #fef3c7; color: #d97706; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600;\">⚠️ WATCH</span></td>\n            