color: #9ca3af;\">N/A</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 12px 8px; text-align: right; color: #9ca3af;\">N/A</td>\n                </tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n            <p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0 0; font-size: 11px; color: #9ca3af;\">*SPXC — portfolio.json still lists this as open, but two IBKR snapshots strongly suggest it already exited at the $205 TP. See Decision #1 above.</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- POSITION DETAIL -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 16px 24px 0 24px;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\">Position Detail</p>\n\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding: 14px 16px;\">\n                  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n                    <tr>\n                      <td><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;\">GOOG</span> <span style=\"margin-left: 8px; padding: 2px 8px; background-color: #fef3c7; color: #d97706; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600;\">⚠️ WATCH</span></td>\n                      <td align=\"right\" style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #9ca3af;\">⚠️ PRICE UNAVAILABLE</td>\n                    </tr>\n                  </table>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.5;\">0.3 sh, entry $364.83. Unverified web snapshot (stockanalysis.com, Oct 10 close): $347.86 — ~4.2% clear of the $333.90 stop and the furthest clear it's looked in weeks, continuing the drift up since early Oct. Still not a live quote; 5 days stale as of today. Own earnings Oct 28 (13 days out) now on the large-cap radar below.</p>\n                  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 10px;\">\n                    <tr>\n                      <td style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #6b7280;\">Stop: <span style=\"color: #111827; font-weight: 600;\">$333.90 (plain STOP)</span></td>\n                      <td style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #6b7280; text-align: right;\">TP1: <span style=\"color: #111827; font-weight: 600;\">$408.00 (GTC limit live)</span></td>\n                    </tr>\n                  </table>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding: 14px 16px;\">\n                  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n                    <tr>\n                      <td><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;\">SPXC</span> <span style=\"margin-left: 8px; padding: 2px 8px; background-color: #ffedd5; color: #ea580c; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600;\">🔔 ACTION</span></td>\n                      <td align=\"right\" style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #9ca3af;\">⚠️ PRICE UNAVAILABLE</td>\n                    </tr>\n                  </table>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.5;\">Defense-rule exit (Kranze Technology Solutions segment) decided 2026-08-25, now 51 calendar days overdue for reconciliation. Two independent IBKR cash snapshots (Sep 29 and Oct 6, 8 days apart, identical: cash $432.16, only GOOG open) point to the $205 TP limit having filled — likely a small net profit, not the $186.90 stop. Purely mechanical from here: confirm in IBKR, run portfolio-manager.</p>\n                  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 10px;\">\n                    <tr>\n                      <td style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #6b7280;\">Stop: <span style=\"color: #111827; font-weight: 600;\">$186.90 (plain STOP)</span></td>\n                      <td style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #6b7280; text-align: right;\">Exit limit: <span style=\"color: #111827; font-weight: 600;\">$205.00 (likely filled)</span></td>\n                    </tr>\n                  </table>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- MOVERS -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 0 24px 0 24px;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\">📈📉 Yesterday's Movers — Oct 14, 2026</p>\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280; line-height: 1.5;\">⚠️ <strong>Unavailable.</strong> Search surfaced no dated recap for Oct 14 — the most recent dated small-cap movers data found was Oct 8 (6 days stale), too old to report as today's movers. Not using it. Nothing substituted.</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- LARGE CAP ON DECK -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 16px 24px 0 24px;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\">🏢 Large-cap on deck — next 21 days</p>\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n              <thead>\n                <tr style=\"background-color: #f9fafb;\">\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Ticker</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Date</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Setup</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Direction</th>\n                </tr>\n              </thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr><td style=\"padding: 10px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight: 600;\">TSLA</td><td style=\"padding: 10px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Oct 20/21 (date unconfirmed between sources)</td><td style=\"padding: 10px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Not held — delivery/margin focus</td><td style=\"padding: 10px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">⚪ Neutral</td></tr>\n                <tr><td style=\"padding: 10px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight: 600;\">MSFT</td><td style=\"padding: 10px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Oct 27 AMC</td><td style=\"padding: 10px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Azure capex guide — read-through to the whole AI-semi complex</td><td style=\"padding: 10px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">🟢 Bullish</td></tr>\n                <tr><td style=\"padding: 10px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight: 600;\">GOOG</td><td style=\"padding: 10px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Oct 28 (your own position)</td><td style=\"padding: 10px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Search/Cloud/Gemini momentum vs. the Sep 18 AI-antitrust overhang</td><td style=\"padding: 10px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">🟢 Bullish</td></tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n            <p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280;\">All three dates are provisional — sources disagree by a day on TSLA and MSFT. Verify via IR before any pre-earnings decision.</p>\n            <p style=\"margin: 10px 0 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #1e40af;\">💡 <strong>MSFT Oct 27</strong> — capex raise would extend the hyperscaler read-through theme. <strong>GOOG Oct 28</strong> — your pre-earnings trim/hold call per the exit-rules template is now 13 days out; decide before the print, not during the gap.</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- PENDING WATCHLIST -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 16px 24px 0 24px;\">\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #1a1400; border-left: 3px solid #f59e0b; border-radius: 6px;\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding: 16px 18px;\">\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #fbbf24; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">⏳ Pending Watchlist</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 12px; color: #d1d5db;\">All 5 entries are fully archived — nothing live to act on:</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #e5e7eb; line-height: 1.8; font-family: monospace;\">\n                    IQV — stopped out Aug 4 @ $227.91, net −$4.56<br>\n                    CELC — exited Jul 15 @ $91.63, net −$26.32 (sell-the-news)<br>\n                    CAPR — stopped out Jul 27 @ $5.80, net −$234.73 (gap-through-stop; the trade that triggered the binary-catalyst pause)<br>\n                    VRDN — approval missed, IBKR blocker, no entry<br>\n                    VERA — stopped out Jul 17 @ $37.74, net −$33.28\n                  </p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- CASH DEPLOYMENT -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 16px 24px 0 24px;\">\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #f0fdf4; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; border-radius: 8px;\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding: 16px 20px;\">\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 11px; color: #166534; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">💵 Cash Deployment</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #14532d; line-height: 1.6;\">\n                    portfolio.json shows $330.60; the Sep 29/Oct 6 IBKR snapshots say ~$432.16. Either way you clear the $30 deployment floor. No fresh candidate generated here — that's <code>stock-finder</code>'s job (runs Tue/Sun), run it on demand if you want ideas for this cash.<br><br>\n                    <strong>Don't add to GOOG.</strong> It's already ~20.6% of net liq — at or past the 15–18% single-name cap even before today's uncertainty about the actual balance.<br><br>\n                    <strong>Your call.</strong>\n                  </p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ROTATION -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 16px 24px 0 24px;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\">🔄 Rotation Suggestions</p>\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280; line-height: 1.5;\">None today. Can't responsibly size a rotation while blind on price for both legs — and SPXC's own status is still unconfirmed. Fix the two decisions above first.</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- IBKR INTELLIGENCE -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 16px 24px 0 24px;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af;\">📊 IBKR Intelligence — not available in routine mode. Trigger daily check in chat for full broker analytics.</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- EDUCATION MODULE -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 16px 24px 24px 24px;\">\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #f1f5f9; border-radius: 8px;\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding: 20px 24px;\">\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 11px; color: #475569; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">📚 Today you learned</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a;\">Implied Volatility Rank (IV Rank)</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 12px 0 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #1e293b; line-height: 1.7;\">\n                    IV Rank tells you whether today's implied volatility is high or low relative to that stock's OWN history — not an absolute number. IV Rank = (current IV − 52-week IV low) / (52-week IV high − 52-week IV low) × 100. GOOG options heading into the Oct 28 print will carry elevated IV just from the event itself, but if IV Rank only reads ~30, that's actually LOW for GOOG specifically — the options market isn't pricing much exceptional risk despite the binary date. IV Rank above ~70 means the move is genuinely feared; low IV Rank with a known catalyst due can mean the market is underpricing it. You don't trade options, but IV Rank context tells you how seriously the market is treating GOOG's print before you make the pre-earnings trim/hold call.\n                  </p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 12px 0 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #475569; font-style: italic;\">\n                    Also today: <em>Vol crush window</em> — the 1–2 days right after a print when IV Rank collapses fastest, independent of how much the stock actually moved.\n                  </p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- FOOTER -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 16px 24px 24px 24px; border-top: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 10px; color: #9ca3af; line-height: 1.5;\">\n              Prices: Yahoo Finance JSON API (query1/query2) and stooq — ALL BLOCKED today (DNS-level ENOTFOUND, confirmed against a google.com control fetch too). 36th consecutive day of zero live price access. Macro/earnings/movers context sourced via web search, not used as a price source. Research output, not financial advice. Past performance does not guarantee future results. Verify halal compliance quarterly. Generated Oct 15, 2026, Kuwait time.\n            </p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n"}